#: rc.cpp:67 rc.cpp:70
msgid ""
"<qt>This label displays what the filename specified in the \"Current filename"
"\" field would be changed to, if renamed according to the token strings, and "
"the filename scheme, as specified above.<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Note that after selecting a file, you can change the token strings, the "
"filename scheme, or the path to the file, and see the resulting impact on "
